msgstr "Luach ri _teachd:"

#. Payment Period Dialog: Description of calculation
#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1143
msgid ""
"Calculates the number of payment periods that are necessary during the term "
"of an ordinary annuity, to accumulate a future value, at a periodic interest "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"Cunntaidh seo an àireamh de dh’fhaidean-ùine pàighidh air a bhiodh feum rè "
"teirm bliadhnachais àbhaistich gus an luach ri teachd a chruinneachadh le "
"luach-rèidh o àm gu àm."

#. Calculates the number of compounding periods necessary to increase an investment of present value pv to a future value of fv, at a fixed interest rate of int per compounding period. See also: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Compound_interest
#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1616
msgid "Ctrm"
msgstr "FùFh"

#. Calculates the depreciation allowance on an asset for a specified period of time, using the double-declining balance method. See also: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Depreciation
#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1632
msgid "Ddb"
msgstr "CrDù"

#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1635
msgid "Double Declining Depreciation"
msgstr "Dìmeasadh crìonaidh dhùbailte"

#. Calculates the future value of an investment based on a series of equal payments, each of amount pmt, at a periodic interest rate of int, over the number of payment periods in the term. See also: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Future_value
#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1648
msgid "Fv"
msgstr "Teachd"

#. Calculates the number of payment periods that are necessary during the term of an ordinary annuity, to accumulate a future value of fv, at a periodic interest rate of int. Each payment is equal to amount pmt. See also: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Annuity_(finance_theory)
#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1664
msgid "Term"
msgstr "Teirm"

#: src/ui/buttons-financial.ui:1667
